<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Enserch started by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Enserch started by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it started coverage of Enserch Exploration Inc as near- and long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 9-1/2 Monday.</p>
</text>
